{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"starving-sphalerite-skua merged as 9a6ed3751128b697d2d7fe8fcbad0b4aa8877621 (Gerrit 3460 patch set 3). Under the revised operator rule, a sound signature by a key that is not on the author's keyring is signer-not-on-keyring: not a bad signature, but it fails enforcement.\n\nEnforced `verify-identity --all` with the merged build, on a fresh no-remote clone of the ORIGINAL tickets history (b878d77e28d):\n`43518 verified, 874 unsigned, 0 unknown-author, 0 bad-signature, 0 key-not-valid-at-era, 6101 signer-not-on-keyring (50493 event(s) in scope)`. Exit 1, with 6,975 enforced events not verified.\n\nThe 6,101 are MCP op-cert-key signatures, filed as promising-unwasteful-xantus. With the 874 unsigned events, they keep enforced verify-identity failing. The rewritten shadow history was not run or touched by this session."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795133848649062001,"uuid":"6c36a21f-59d6-4590-bb95-5ccbd437192b"}